<title>INDIA: Indian Aluminium Co 1996/97 first half net down.</title>
<headline>Indian Aluminium Co 1996/97 first half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit     382.1     vs     482.7</p>
<p>    Net sales    4,946.4     vs    4,805.4</p>
<p>    Other income    55.5     vs	110.7</p>
<p>    Expenditure  4,220.2     vs    3,830.0</p>
<p>    Interest	 237.0     vs	250.4</p>
<p>    Gross profit   544.7     vs	835.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation   187.0     vs	183.4</p>
<p>    VRS payment	4.7     vs	  3.6</p>
<p>    Taxation	  56.6     vs	166.0</p>
<p>Note:Indian Aluminium Company Ltd said it completed a 6,000 tpa expansion of Hirakud smelter during the first half, taking its capacity to 30,000 tpa. The results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
